From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 15:54:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rt(data,tse): light the 1_2_Palenque start cave in RT

The 1_2_Palenque RT level start showed a black 3D view in the spawn cave
(Vulkan fine). The cave is lit in SE1 only by invisible static light
entities (3 bluish fill lights, torch glow lights at the temple door);
RT ignores static spherical lights without a visible model
(CustomInfo::IsSphericalLightIgnored), and no sun or sky light reaches
the closed cave. Lowering tonemapping_min_log_luminance to -12 changed
nothing.

Whitelist the 25 static lights within 80 m of the spawn with
cutscene_light (position match), found with a temporary debug listing.
Data only; world coordinates, no texture paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTSE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/SamTSE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt b/SamTSE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt
index c92ebda1ae5ae47bf7c0b5af31725a7beea039e0..044ef85b2b7cc056f97370f1bb22e04560591c0a 100644
--- a/SamTSE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt
+++ b/SamTSE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt
@@ -69,7 +69,40 @@ haze = 0                                  # was 1: made everything beyond ~20 m
 sky_type = geometry
 
 [world 1_2_Palenque]
-tuned = 0    # placeholder: generic defaults from [defaults]
+# Observed 2026-11-28 (EXP-018 A3): the level starts in a closed cave that SE1 lights only with
+# invisible static light entities (3 bluish fill lights along the cave, torch glow lights at the
+# temple door). RT ignores static spherical lights without a visible model
+# (CustomInfo::IsSphericalLightIgnored), so the spawn was pitch black. cutscene_light whitelists
+# a static light by its position (Manhattan distance < 0.5); positions from a debug listing of
+# the ignored lights within 80 m of the spawn. Not play-tested beyond the cave [ASM].
+tuned = 0
+haze = 0
+sky_type = geometry
